                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the ideal points earn rate?</h3>
                                        <p>3-5% of purchase value. Above 5% erodes margin; below 3% doesn't drive behaviour.</p>
                                        <h3>Yotpo Loyalty or custom build?</h3>
                                        <p>Yotpo / LoyaltyLion / Swell for most brands under 500K members. Custom for larger, more complex, or when platform limits become blockers.</p>
                                        <h3>Should loyalty rewards be discount-only?</h3>
                                        <p>No — non-discount rewards (early access, private events, experiences) build habit better than pure discount. Discount trains customers to game the system.</p>
                                        <h3>Is paid membership (Amazon Prime pattern) worth building?</h3>
                                        <p>Only at scale (₹100+ Cr ARR) with strong retention flywheel already. Below that, free tiered loyalty is better.</p>
